ypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"9dff78e2-2458-4d80-abfd-858da5b02ae8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ca86ac74-b393-4b38-8e69-5ddecc3498f5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LrkgzgVZG79v1vGsPV8pqK","type":"tool_result","content":"PBR textures (stone courses and mortar, peeling paint, rusted and chipped\nsteel, hessian, wool, bark and moss, with occlusion, grime and rain streaks\nbaked in), foliage is alpha cards rendered from modelled leaves, and the\nrenderer adds wet reflective ground with puddle ripples, rain lit by lamps and\nfires, halos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes and scorch marks, distant\nartillery flashes and burning farms beyond the hedges. Lamps and fires cast\nsoft shadows and their light hangs in the rain between you and them, corners\nand the ground under things darken, and the frame is finished like film —\ncontrast, sharpening, grain in the shadows — going soft behind whatever you\naim at.\n\n    `effects.js` (particles), `atmosphere.js` (halos, mist, decals),\n    `audio.js` (procedural)\n  * the effects chain (`renderer.setEffects`, in order): `ssao.js` ambient\n    occlusion at half resolution · `volumetric.js` lays the occlusion on\n    and adds the light scattered in the rain by up to eight lamps, fires and\n    flashes (the closed-form airlight integral, cut by the depth) · `dof.js`\n    focus on what is under the crosshair while aiming · `bloom.js` ·\n    `post.js` the grade (sharpening, contrast, colour, vignette, grain, the\n    hurt state); the high and medium qualities run all of it, low only the\n    grade\n* `assets/models/*.glb` — built by the Blender scripts in `tools/blender/`;","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b8429934-d50f-46e2-b39f-4dcb6e9ab0c4","timestamp":"2026-10-21T11:47:54.127Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"PBR textures (stone courses and mortar, peeling paint, rusted and chipped\nsteel, hessian, wool, bark and moss, with occlusion, grime and rain streaks\nbaked in), foliage is alpha cards rendered from modelled leaves, and the\nrenderer adds wet reflective ground with puddle ripples, rain lit by lamps and\nfires, halos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes and scorch marks, distant\nartillery flashes and burning farms beyond the hedges. Lamps and fires cast\nsoft shadows and their light hangs in the rain between you and them, corners\nand the ground under things darken, and the frame is finished like film —\ncontrast, sharpening, grain in the shadows — going soft behind whatever you\naim at.\n\n    `effects.js` (particles), `atmosphere.js` (halos, mist, decals),\n    `audio.js` (procedural)\n  * the effects chain (`renderer.setEffects`, in order): `ssao.js` ambient\n    occlusion at half resolution · `volumetric.js` lays the occlusion on\n    and adds the light scattered in the rain by up to eight lamps, fires and\n    flashes (the closed-form airlight integral, cut by the depth) · `dof.js`\n    focus on what is under the crosshair while aiming · `bloom.js` ·\n    `post.js` the grade (sharpening, contrast, colour, vignette, grain, the\n    hurt state); the high and medium qualities run all of it, low only the\n    grade\n* `assets/models/*.glb` — built by the Blender scripts in `tools/blender/`;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e1b80535-e41f-4bc9-ada1-119ddc4f8209","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow","branch":"hedgerow-poc","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":5,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":