{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"e255e688f52ce1aeff9289c29392746edcc51cf9e3eb2de52db6f8af00782124","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NpYQENhWXX7zT7FJrqU9kZ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"renderer adds wet reflective ground with puddle ripples, rain lit by lamps and\nfires, halos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes and scorch marks, distant","new_string":"renderer adds wet ground — dark, glossy cobbles with water in the joints,\npuddles in the hollows that mirror the lit windows, the lamps and the glow\nof the sky, broken by rain rings — rain lit by lamps and\nfires, halos in the wet air, low mist, bullet holes and scorch marks, distant"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Gh71ghgbWGud1kcHeRdY3c","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"  * the effects chain (`renderer.setEffects`, in order): `ssao.js` ambient\n    occlusion at half resolution · `volumetric.js` lays the occlusion on\n    and adds the light scattered in the rain by up to eight lamps, fires and","new_string":"  * the effects chain (`renderer.setEffects`, in order): `ssao.js` ambient\n    occlusion at half resolution · `ssr.js` reflections in the wet ground,\n    the puddles and the river, at half resolution (a ray marched through the\n    depth from each pixel the scene pass marked as mirror-like in its alpha,\n    `mirrorAlpha`) · `volumetric.js` lays the occlusion and the reflections on\n    and adds the light scattered in the rain by up to eight lamps, fires and"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QxUJuQQqFM8hjKeMn8fyFH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow && git status --short fun/hedgerow && git add fun/hedgerow/js/ssr.js fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js fun/hedgerow/js/terrain.js fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/js/config.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: reflections in the wet streets\n\nThe scene pass now writes how mirror-like each pixel is into its alpha\n(terrain, wet tops and the river, from the wet roughness; transparent\nthings drawn over only raise it). A half-resolution pass (ssr.js) marches\nthe reflected ray through the depth for those pixels: puddles mirror the\nlit windows, the lamps, the truck's lights and the houses opposite,\nruffled by the same rain rings the terrain draws; a rough film scatters\nits rays into the long streaks of a wet road; a ray that meets nothing\nnear reflects what lies where its direction vanishes on screen (the glow\nof the sky, far roofs). The light-in-the-rain pass lays it on with the\nocclusion's depth-aware upsample.\n\nStanding water now fills the ground up to a level, the joints between\ncobbles and the hollows of the mud first, then the stones, instead of a\nuniform 60 % film over the road; the road's stones are darker and glossier\nwhen wet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit round 6, the wet-street reflections"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
