{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"8712e5cb-5c17-4f78-8159-fe8e322bd52d","hash":"e860be2278a9438e78a72370913e5af57b6c3561aa2bb705b4efe55b95c9c5f0","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UmhVGGsXe45FtL169CDkLC","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"renderer adds wet ground — dark, glossy cobbles with water in the joints,\npuddles in the hollows that mirror the lit windows, the lamps and the glow\nof the sky, broken by rain rings — rain lit by lamps and","new_string":"renderer adds wet ground — dark, glossy cobbles with water in the joints,\npuddles with soaked margins in the hollows that mirror the lit windows, the\nlamps and the glow of the sky, broken by rain rings, river banks soaked\nabove the waterline, a forest floor of last year's leaves with moss in the\ndamp — rain lit by lamps and"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014mZ8BhFTCHosnkSnTeimFb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow && git status --short fun/hedgerow && git add fun/hedgerow/tools/textures.py fun/hedgerow/assets/textures/forest.webp fun/hedgerow/assets/textures/forest_n.webp fun/hedgerow/js/terrain.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: a leafy forest floor, softer puddles, soaked river banks\n\nThe forest floor texture was littered with domed ellipses that lit like\npebbles; it is now last year's beech and oak leaves lying flat (pointed,\na paler midrib, edges curling a little) in drifts over needles and soil,\nand the terrain spreads moss through the damp and drifts of leaves at a\nlarger scale.\n\nPuddles in the mud no longer go black: the ground shows through the water\nonly a little darker, and a soaked, glossier margin rings each one. The\nriver banks darken and turn glossy up to a hand above the waterline (and\nreflect, with the new reflections).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the terrain round"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
