{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"e21146ef82fba8bed87cd7fcffad6f9c34dfc02675c3328bdc68b08ea4c6492d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Grass rendering costs about 1.1 ms at 1024×768, scaling to 2-2.5 ms at high quality—manageable but worth optimizing. Since distant tufts are mostly sub-pixel anyway, I'll reduce them to fewer, wider blades beyond a few metres.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DXETq2vrvxXydkkBm5aSA6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\np = 'js/grass.js'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"        // this blade of the tuft: where it comes up, how tall, which way it faces\n        vec4 b = hash4(cell + vec2(7919.0 * (position.z + 1.0), 104729.0));\n        float ang = b.x * 6.2831853;\n        vec2 off = vec2(cos(ang), sin(ang)) * (0.02 + 0.1 * sqrt(b.y));\n        vec2 xz = root + off;\n        float hgt = tuftH * mix(0.55, 1.0, b.z);\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"        // further out a tuft is fewer, wider blades (the rest are under a pixel anyway)\n        float blades = floor(mix(${TUFT}.5, 2.5, smoothstep(5.0, uRadius * 0.75, dist)));\n        tuftH *= step(position.z, blades - 0.5);\n        // this blade of the tuft: where it comes up, how tall, which way it faces\n        vec4 b = hash4(cell + vec2(7919.0 * (position.z + 1.0), 104729.0));\n        float ang = b.x * 6.2831853;\n        vec2 off = vec2(cos(ang), sin(ang)) * (0.02 + 0.1 * sqrt(b.y));\n        vec2 xz = root + off;\n        float hgt = tuftH * mix(0.55, 1.0, b.z);\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"\"\"        float w = mix(0.0035, 0.007, b.y) * (1.0 - t * 0.8) * inversesqrt(keep);\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"        float w = mix(0.0035, 0.007, b.y) * (1.0 - t * 0.8) * inversesqrt(keep) * sqrt(${TUFT}.0 / blades);\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPYEOF\nnode --check js/grass.js && echo parsed","description":"Draw fewer, wider blades per tuft at distance"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
