 quality's near range","new_string":"    set has one, the `_lod` impostor beyond the quality's near range ·\n    `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU: one instanced draw of tufts of\n    blades round the camera (high ~21 m, medium ~14 m, none on low), each\n    placed, sized and leaned by a hash of its world cell, on a ground map\n    made at load from the terrain's own splat (none on roads, mud, steep\n    banks, at the water or inside anything solid); the ground under it\n    turns to dark, dry sward"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b6535484-fada-49a4-b931-f05a80080960","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFS11Z3oihkRRBVDGVvP","requestRef":"14ba926d-a56e-4924-8f57-dae3eadadc33","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2bc8954b-a1d4-46cc-9f38-f750eb91f6b3","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:06:08.927Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-grass","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
