{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"413b372dcb0c0a862ee26a38060ef50d6d186ef05e3ab9e6e08bf016f27e3dda","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01As2axE9Dp4jXWqJdKPdXpP","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"baked in), foliage is alpha cards rendered from modelled leaves, and the","new_string":"baked in), foliage is alpha cards rendered from modelled leaves, meadows\nand verges are tens of thousands of single blades of grass that bend in\nthe wind and part round your legs, and the"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016JRnPT8M7RKnasmjuSCcDJ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"    set has one, the `_lod` impostor beyond the quality's near range","new_string":"    set has one, the `_lod` impostor beyond the quality's near range ·\n    `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU: one instanced draw of tufts of\n    blades round the camera (high ~21 m, medium ~14 m, none on low), each\n    placed, sized and leaned by a hash of its world cell, on a ground map\n    made at load from the terrain's own splat (none on roads, mud, steep\n    banks, at the water or inside anything solid); the ground under it\n    turns to dark, dry sward"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DKwinVz2kjAkG6hct6mAeo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && L=\"$TMPDIR\"; for t in world-check lod-check distance-check ai-check; do node tests/$t.mjs > \"$L/$t.log\" 2>&1 && echo \"$t ok: $(tail -1 \"$L/$t.log\" | cut -c1-110)\" || { echo \"$t FAILED\"; tail -8 \"$L/$t.log\"; }; done","description":"Run the world, LOD, distance and AI tests","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
