and the next village","new_string":"    the level, open towards the far buildings) and the next village\n  * `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU: one instanced draw of tufts of\n    blades round the camera (high ~21 m, medium ~14 m, none on low), each\n    placed, sized and leaned by a hash of its world cell, on a ground map\n    made at load from the terrain's own splat (none on roads, mud, steep\n    banks, at the water or inside anything solid); the ground under it\n    turns to dark, dry sward"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f1896cf2-9a37-45bc-896a-24dcf13bbe25","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFSBxwqTauXd7ccp4KHr","requestRef":"d471862a-55aa-44d4-a314-80382adfce64","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca691143-ea05-4aa9-8732-368c45ec5c62","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:08:34.987Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-grass","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
